{
  "info": {
    "name": "routeid (homelab 192.168.1.219)",
    "description": "Router OSM Indonesia - deploy homelab i3-6100T, region java + sumatra. URL absolut http://192.168.1.219:8080 (tanpa variabel, supaya import langsung jalan di Hoppscotch maupun Postman).\n\nKapasitas terukur: ~11 RPS untuk rute 42 km, ~17 RPS untuk 15 km, saturasi di 4 query paralel. Tanpa auth + CORS *, jangan expose ke internet.\n\nKalau server jalan di mesin lain, cukup ganti host di setiap URL.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. healthz (region + turn restriction)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://192.168.1.219:8080/healthz",
        "description": "Cek dua region termuat: java (22,7 jt node) dan sumatra (11,9 jt node), plus statistik ban belok."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('dua region', () => pm.expect(j.regions.map(r => r.name)).to.eql(['java','sumatra']));",
              "console.log(j.regions.map(r => r.name + ':' + r.nodes).join(', '));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Yogyakarta 15 km (points, aman)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://192.168.1.219:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593",
        "description": "Warung Sembako Arum -> KiriminAja HQ. Array [lat,lng], tanpa decoder. Harus 14.666 m / 476 titik."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('ada region + jarak', () => { pm.expect(j.region).to.be.a('string'); pm.expect(j.distance_m).to.be.above(0); });",
              "pm.test('points_n cocok', () => pm.expect(j.points).to.have.lengthOf(j.points_n));",
              "console.log(j.region, j.distance_m + 'm', j.points_n + ' titik');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Yogyakarta 15 km (geojson -> geojson.io)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://192.168.1.219:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593&format=geojson",
        "description": "Field geojson: FeatureCollection, tanpa backslash. Copy isi field itu ke geojson.io."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const g = pm.response.json().geojson;",
              "pm.test('LineString 476 titik', () => { pm.expect(g.features[0].geometry.type).to.eql('LineString'); pm.expect(g.features[0].geometry.coordinates).to.have.lengthOf(476); });"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Yogyakarta 15 km (polyline + polyline_b64)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "http://192.168.1.219:8080/route?from=-7.8435723,110.392939&to=-7.7393368,110.3760593&format=polyline",
        "description": "Format Google. Respons memuat polyline_b64 (base64 dari string yang sama) — pakai itu kalau mau copy-paste, karena charset polyline memuat '\\' yang tampil dobel di JSON."
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "const j = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('polyline & b64 ada', () => { pm.expect(j.polyline).to.be.a('string'); pm.expect(j.polyline_b64).to.be.a('string'); });",
              "pm.test('b64 = base64(polyline)', () => pm.expect(atob(j.polyline_b64)).to.eql(j.polyline));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
